  "goodToKnow": "Humanistisch means humanist: ein humanistisches Weltbild. In education, ein humanistisches Gymnasium is a classical grammar school teaching Latin and Ancient Greek, and humanistische Bildung means a classical education. Der Humanismus was the Renaissance movement reviving antiquity; Erasmus and Johannes Reuchlin were leading figures. Don't confuse it with humanitär (humanitarian) or human (humane)."
